      anh c\u1EA7m l\u1EA5y \u0111i!"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  alreadySavedLines:
  - speaker: "T\xED"
    text: "C\u1EA3m \u01A1n anh m\u1ED9t l\u1EA7n n\u1EEFa. H\xE3y mau ng\u0103n
      ch\u1EB7n nh\xE0 m\xE1y x\u1EA3 th\u1EA3i!"
